  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>The Nike Vomero 17 is a men's running shoe built for daily road miles with a soft, smooth ride. A dual-density midsole pairs ZoomX with Cushlon 3.0 foam to balance responsive cushioning with consistent comfort underfoot, while the engineered mesh upper helps airflow during steady runs and longer training sessions. MR-10 shaping supports a familiar fit, and the redesigned outsole helps keep transitions flexible from heel to toe.</p><p>Nike Vomero 17 features:</p><ul><li>ZoomX and Cushlon 3.0 foam combine for a soft, responsive underfoot feel.</li><li>Engineered mesh upper helps keep airflow moving through daily runs.</li><li>MR-10 shaping delivers Nike's consistent fit through the foot.</li><li>Waffle-inspired outsole with break points promotes flexible heel-to-toe transitions.</li><li>10 mm heel-to-toe drop supports a smooth, rolling stride.</li></ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 17 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Platinum Tint/Summit White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td